{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】屯門有工業大廈棚架起火，逾二百人疏散，無人受傷。</p>\n<p>從網上片段見到，大廈外牆棚架冒出火舌，部分棚網正在燃燒，濃煙升上半空。</p>\n<p>現場是屯門建發里2號一座工業大廈。火警大約於下午2時發生，消防接報後派出一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，約四十分後火警大致被救熄。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:35:56.458112+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T08:02:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T08:49:56.983403+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:29:35.082559+00:00","content_hash":"0717e481cee12b31d41d0fcd1e29366cf3217a267a15fbdd5c01b829344c116d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}